 illogical this idea is.", "What are we reincarnated based on? They'll tell you: based on what you did in your previous life. OK, so where do I get this description of what is good and bad, so I can avoid the bad and do the good, so I can make sure that I am reincarnated in a better state? If I'm reincarnated as a fly or a frog or whatever, like most people say, what can I do as a frog or a fly to come back ever as a human being again?", "Even if you still believe that only humans are reincarnated, you still have the same issue: if it was souls recycled, then it would be always the same number of human beings just being recycled. They're not going to increase. They're not going to be 100,000 and then become 100 million. It's not going to happen unless something is generating souls. Also, it doesn't answer the question to begin with, of where did these souls come from that are being reincarnated? It needs a starting point again. So when you present these things, you just bring yourself more problems than solutions, really.", "Also, you told me you value human life, because of love and respect. These are subjective terms! Why do I need to value human life, or does anyone?",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Muslim Refutes Inconsistent Atheist Criticizing The Actions Of God! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eOMW7R6z_wg", ((1137, "18:57–19:40"), (1202, "20:02–20:32"), (1237, "20:37–21:12"), (1275, "21:15–21:49"), (1315, "21:55–22:12"), (1347, "22:27–22:59"), (1385, "23:05–23:10"),))
