#passage(("Now [he] implies that if you are claiming to be reviving or retaking a holy temple or place of worship, it is wrong; therefore Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wasallam was unjust in taking the [Kaaba]. Well, according to the Bible, the temple of Jerusalem was taken by the pagans and it was violated, and images of goddesses placed inside of it. Now priests of God came and removed these idols and reclaimed it for Allah subhana wa ta'ala. Then he should have no issue and no problem with reclaiming the [Kaaba] from the hands of the [mushrik] and remaking it a place of worship for the sake of Allah alone.", "There were literally idols and images of [Isa] and Ibraim in the [Kaaba], which suggests that the Christians and Jews of the area held the [Kaaba] to be a holy site. There is evidence from non-Muslim sources that Arabian Christians and Jews did honor and respect the [Kaaba].",), "Farid Responds, “[DEBUNKED] The Truth about the Kaaba - Apostate Prophet”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EYzTV_Q-nh0", ((292, "4:52–5:51"), (370, "6:10–6:30"),))
